OL,3,GNEWSATraders 'priced out' of #12,000
OL,4,AChristmas market pitches
OL,5,
OL,6,FTraders claim they have been priced out
OL,7,Fof this year's Christmas market.
OL,9,FThey have told Liverpool City Council
OL,10,Fleader Liam Robinson that they cannot
OL,11,Fafford to take space at the event now
OL,12,Fthat a new operator has taken over
OL,13,Frunning it.
OL,15,FAnthony Grice said he had been quoted
OL,16,F#12,000 to take a stall at the St
OL,17,FGeorge's Plateau attraction.
OL,23,APub: 08-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
