OL,3,GNEWSATraders 'priced out' of #12,000
OL,4,AChristmas market pitches
OL,5,
OL,6,FRobinson said he had met business
OL,7,Fowners to "understand the challenges
OL,8,Fand the issues that they might have had
OL,9,Fthis year" so the authority could look
OL,10,Fat different options in future.
